  usecase "SFR012: Manage User Feedback for Improvement" as SFR012
  
  Sys --> (SFR002) : Deliver recommendations\nSys --> (SFR003) : Request AI-generated predictions\nSys --> (SFR004) : Request personalized recs from AI\nSys --> (SFR005) : Request spending limit alerts\nSys --> (SFR006) : Analyze investment opportunities for users\nSys --> (SFR007) : Find specific ESG-aligned investments\nSys --> (SFR008) : Detect potential fraud via AI\nSys --> (SFR009) : Extract portfolio-relevant news\nSys --> (SFR10) : Create dashboards\nSys --> SFR012 : Collect and process user feedback
